  "zh": "# 沙特机场袭击致重伤亡，Nvidia洽谈收购AI初创，OpenAI称解四维猜想\n## 国际安全\n- **沙特机场袭击**：袭击致12死309伤，引发地区安全担忧。\n- **美沙军事合作**：美方考虑加入沙特对胡塞打击，影响中东局势。\n## 科技产业\n- **Nvidia收购AI**：Nvidia洽谈收购开源模型初创，强化算力布局。\n- **OpenAI称解四维猜想**：宣称解决数学难题，若成立将推动AI理论突破。\n## 社会民生\n- **女孩夺舞冠**：11岁成都女孩夺得世界街舞冠军，彰显中国街舞实力。\n- **新能源经验**：中国新能源产业发展经验获关注，被视为全球典范。",
  "en": "# Saudi airport attack causes heavy casualties; Nvidia in talks to buy AI startup; OpenAI claims solving 4‑D packing conjecture\n## International Security\n- **Saudi airport hit**：Attack killed 12 and injured 309, raising regional security concerns.\n- **US strike talks**：Washington considers joining Saudi‑led action against Houthi targets.\n## Tech Industry\n- **Nvidia buys AI**：Nvidia is in talks to acquire open‑model startup Reflection AI to boost its AI compute stack.\n- **OpenAI 4D claim**：OpenAI says it has solved the four‑dimensional sphere‑packing conjecture, a potential breakthrough for AI theory.\n## Social Livelihood\n- **Girl wins dance**：An 11‑year‑old girl from Chengdu won the world street‑dance championship, highlighting China’s strength in the sport.\n- **China new energy**：China’s new‑energy industry experience is drawing global attention as a model of policy‑driven growth."
